WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.960
The defense of Angel Halo was centered around...

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.900
...the deployment of Mutterma Sugan's space fleet.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.900
When the League Militaire Fleet was been unable to break through,

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:43.100
Tassilo Wago launched a one-man mutiny against Kagatie...

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.930
...and kidnapped Maria.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.930
THE WOMEN'S BATTLEFIELD

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.730
"The Women's Battlefield".
THE WOMEN'S BATTLEFIELD

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:01.360
We believe this region has been exposed to the waves from Angel Halo.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.300
It caused people in the area to fall into a state of sleep.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.230
The Regression Effect, as you call it.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:09.660
Regression...

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.630
You mean it's turning them into infants?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.460
This video shows us what's happening...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.330
...to those who are most susceptible to it.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:21.530
Unfortunately, this isn't the story of "Sleeping Beauty."

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.260
A life form left to sleep will just decay.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.560
Correct.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.100
If we allow Angel Halo to land on Earth,

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.030
I believe it will cause cellular degeneration,

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.860
leading to premature aging and death.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.900
How about the V2 Buster's missile pod?!

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:12.800
Boy! You won't escape me this time!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.230
Does she have a limitless energy pack?!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.330
She dodged them!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.860
Let's try it!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.960
What?! Mines?!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.260
Is that fleet headed for the moon?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.160
T-The Shubaten, possibly!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.960
I won't let you reach Tassilo!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.360
Why aren't you bringing Shahkti with us?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.860
It's possible that Shahkti is collaborating with those League Militaire kids.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:01.830
Collaborating?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.800
As in, they sense each other.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.530
It can't be...

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:08.260
Angel Halo has already been activated once.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.700
Still, handing Shahkti over to Kagatie was...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.100
Unavoidable.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:19.100
I don't have the power to keep her under my authority.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.130
I have to pray within these rings, then?

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.330
Yes.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:32.960
By doing that, Angel Halo will amplify your prayer,

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.960
broadcasting it across the battlefield.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:41.460
And that will make all those who are fighting forget their hostility?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.530
Yes.

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.300
No need for old men to wield political power anymore.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.630
This is for true peace for all mankind.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:51.500
You've explained enough. Let me pray.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:55.000
Everyone, please, lend me your strength.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:58.130
Let my prayer calm the people.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.000
Let hatred be erased from this place.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.130
Is it working?

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.700
Yes, sir. There's a high probability of success.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.430
Prime Minister Kagatie, this is wonderful!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.700
The princess's psycho power is pure and strong.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.500
Of course. Like mother, like daughter.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.200
Just as I expected.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:21.100
Which is what makes it so unforgivable.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.330
Damn that Cronicle...

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.430
...for concealing that Maria's child was so nearby!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.560
The Reineforce is moving through the south field, correct?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.160
Yes. It looks like the White Ark has gone too far ahead.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.600
Isn't Jinn Jahannam worried...

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.700
...about that fleet that was headed to the rear of Angel Halo?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.200
You mean for Angel Halo's defense?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.260
It was probably Tassilo's Shubaten.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.330
They're going back to their own territory.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.500
It is troubling.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.400
It may be worth having this ship catch up with them on our own.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.700
Let's follow the Reineforce.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.600
We're otherwise unoccupied, so let's follow them.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.230
The bells!

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.600
Üso!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.430
Who?!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:34.600
Shahkti has been left behind at Angel Halo with Cronicle.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.830
Maria... That's Maria's voice!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:44.660
Maria called to me! Isn't she at Angel Halo?

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.200
How do you know that?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.360
She's there!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.600
I was arrogant.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.360
Through the machinery of Angel Halo,

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:56.600
I believed I could send a prayer of peace to all people.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:00.130
But the machine only partially worked.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.800
Because, more than anything, I became too much of an adult.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.960
Too possessed by wickedness and passions.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:12.400
I was captured by this man, Tassilo, due to my unworthiness.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.760
A woman's deeds bring forth sadness.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.930
She's a woman, too!

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:23.030
Boy, you're distracted by another woman while you're in front of me?!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.830
You're being rude to me, the woman right here!

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.560
Miss Fuala!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:36.830
Quiet! The Minovsky particles are finally thinning out.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.200
You're going out again?

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:43.300
Since the Reineforce Junior brought us another V1, I have to go out, right?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.330
Martina, no problems with the docking linkage, right?

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:47.760
All clear!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.860
You still don't have a fix on the V2?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:55.460
I just see blinking dots on this laser sensor thing.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.400
Since we're keeping still, the computer will ID them for us.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.430
I see a big dot now!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.530
That's it!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.660
Are there any other dots moving near him?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.630
None. It's just the V2.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.300
The V1's taking the cannon stored on the ship's underside.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.730
Roger! The ship's about to rock!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.000
Grab onto Flanders and whatever you can!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.300
Honestly, this is such a pain.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.130
Miss Marbet just left.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.360
Will she be okay, having to constantly sortie?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.430
I'm more worried about us and the White Ark.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:39.500
Üso, I know. I know where you are.

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:43.900
It's like I hear your heartbeat, along with the sound of bells.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:49.830
I want to send you to be with Metchet!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.530
I can't let you do that!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.260
Resistance is futile, Boy!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:11.400
You've given me all sorts of fun, Boy!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.830
I know! I know where the bells are ringing!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:24.260
Boy, you're adorable! Shall I play with you a bit longer?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.930
She's tormenting Üso!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.530
Yes... I know where you are!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:39.100
Another white one?! Then I'll play with you!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:40.860
Malfunction!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:47.230
Üso, use my Hanger and Boots!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.000
Where are those Boots for V2?!

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.430
Don't mess with me!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.460
Stop ringing those bells!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.530
What good is that mini-fighter?!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.030
She's fast!

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.600
I'll cut everyone in half with the guillotine!

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:10.700
What?!

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.330
What?

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:29.160
Two lives in one?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.500
Why?!

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:31.960
She's a woman!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:47.930
What?

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.660
Get away from Miss Marbet!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.200
You child!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:06.630
You think you've found an opening, Boy?!

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.830
If I cut off her head, that life will vanish!

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:14.500
Then I'll no longer have the light of that life to fear!

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:18.630
If you'd abandon the bells of the guillotine, you would know peace, Miss Fuala!

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:24.960
Boy!

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:28.760
You're too much of a woman!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:34.060
That's also light! And life is light!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.430
The guillotine blade is shining!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.600
Tassilo!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.160
You're on your own, now!

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:50.730
Metchet! I'm coming to you now!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.860
The bells have fallen.

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:04.330
That mobile suit pilot... She was a woman, wasn't she?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.830
No, a soldier.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.900
Who became a woman.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.500
You say too much, Queen.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.700
I will only treat you as a queen...

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:18.200
...once Fonse Kagatie is dead and I see how useful you'll be to me.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.030
And how will you use my powers?

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:24.960
To build a mother empire, centered around you.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.130
That's all.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.760
Üso... Are you crying, Üso?

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.500
No, I'm not!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:42.230
Is there anything sadder than becoming an adult while crying?

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.830
Ahead, just in front of the 6th squadron of the Mutterma Sugan Fleet...

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.960
...appears to be the League Militaire flagship.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.500
Send our vanguard mobile suit units forward.

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.460
Have the message come from the rearline units.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.800
Operational order?

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.400
Find the enemy flagship Jeanne d'Arc!

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:16.960
A new fleet seems to be coming out from Angel Halo!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:17.900
Numbers?

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:19.430
Six to eight!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.500
It must be the Motorad Fleet that retreated.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:24.400
They're going to engage us.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:28.330
Yes, sir. Should we keep following the Reineforce?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.630
My instincts are telling me we need to catch up to it.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.260
Miss Marbet sortied again?!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.860
Üso couldn't do it on his own!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.860
Where's the Reineforce?

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.260
Headed for Üso's position.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:42.130
Dammit!

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.530
We could try using the radar a little.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:46.700
The Jeanne d'Arc's approaching too, isn't it?

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:49.130
Yeah, it looks like they're chasing the fleet that retreated.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:53.160
Odelo, don't come in. We'll reload the Gun Blasters' weaponry.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.600
I'll go out. You and Odelo should get some rest.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.660
Please.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.860
Karel, isn't there a debris shoal ahead?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.000
Get close to it.

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:04.560
I'm looking for it with the telescope.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.530
I'll go, too.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.530
Karl's asleep again.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:27.130
These net mines look usable, Üso.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:28.500
Thanks.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.060
The White Ark should be coming.

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.460
Miss Marbet, please go back to the ship.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.560
Üso, a single mobile suit in a free-for-all will be...

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.560
You should head to the rear, for the baby's sake, too.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.600
What are you talking about?!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:46.200
It's not that strange that you're carrying a baby, Miss Marbet.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:48.300
We're still not certain.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.000
But we will be, soon.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:54.260
Please, use the V1 to protect yourself and your baby.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.830
That's what machines are for.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.660
I guess.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.300
Then, please, go back to the White Ark.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:04.000
I don't want everyone worrying about me, so-

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:08.160
I'm going for the Shubaten. Shahkti's on Angel Halo, but...

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.100
But with Fuala Griffon gone, you can fight the Shubaten now, right?

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.460
Right.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:19.500
Maria is the symbol of Zanscare. I think we should capture her.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:26.960
Üso...

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:31.800
Inside me... is Oliver's baby.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.630
V2's light wings!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.100
Üso's still okay!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:44.000
Wagman! Hold our course! The Jeanne d'Arc is coming, too!

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.700
Informing the Shrike Team!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:46.700
Oh...

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.730
Women are the ones who bear life and protect it.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:55.500
But I used Angel Halo to reduce people to primitives.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.760
Is there any way I can make amends?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.360
Shahkti...

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:02.960
A child?

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.900
Yes, perhaps what we need now is the compassion of children.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.260
Enemy cruiser's defenses are solid, Üso!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.430
I know!

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:20.760
Boys, children, come to me!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:23.660
I heard that! The voice of Shahkti's mother!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.300
You're hearing things! Hearing things!

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:27.700
An all range scan shows no signals!

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.730
I feel it in my mind! Sensors don't pick up intuition!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:48.960
Tomáš! I'm breaking through the ships ahead of us!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.760
Odelo, no! You shouldn't go in too deep!

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.060
You've got some nerve! Your fleet's running away!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:05.030
Look! We can just come around them from the north field!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.960
Release dummies to the front!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.660
R-Roger, Miss Juca!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.730
When the balloons are destroyed, open fire! Okay, Karel?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:17.300
Right!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:18.100
Warren!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.830
Leave the missiles to me!

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:20.800
Here they come!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.660
The unit I sent Fuala to deal with is coming this way?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.460
What's wrong?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.930
The two ships to the rear are in a tough battle, sir!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:40.200
Send out our reserves as well!

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:42.760
No specific orders! Just have them do what they can!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.800
Sir! Sir!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.360
What is this strange development?

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.700
Who could have them attack us like this?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.200
Maria!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:55.630
It must be. Fuala, it's that woman!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.430
Tomáš, did you hear a woman's voice?

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.960
You heard it too, Odelo?

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.760
I heard it. It came from in front of us!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:09.300
To save many lives,

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.060
these two minds must be destroyed!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.400
Who is to be destroyed?

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.530
You're calling the enemy?!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.700
Boys, whose souls sense my call!

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.130
Two Gun Blasters, moving into formation.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.500
Roger! Closing in on that ship!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:28.730
Leave this to the Shrike Team and the Reineforce!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.160
We're covering V2!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:43.060
Here comes the second group! Nobody get killed!

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.800
Everyone in my unit is dead now.

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:52.360
I don't want people calling me the Grim Reaper!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.560
If I can help those boys, I'll be able to wipe away that disgrace!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.960
Even with all the firepower we've gathered,

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.900
it may not be enough!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.900
No, the Jeanne d'Arc is coming up behind us!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.700
They're going to engage them ship-to-ship!

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:11.200
Karel, pull back from the south field to open a path for them!

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:11.960
Right!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:22.200
If we can conquer this airspace, Angel Halo's encirclement will collapse!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.360
Forward, like we mean to ram them!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.900
Enemy fleet, charging us!

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:32.130
Intercept! No, retreat! Evasive action!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:32.930
Aye, sir!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:40.200
Here they come! It's going to hit us!

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:49.630
This unit's used to fighting in space!

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.930
Where'd Üso go?! Above us!

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.000
They're running!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.160
The Reineforce?

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.660
It's the Jeanne d'Arc!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.500
The ship my dad's on?

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.830
Dad came!

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:18.460
Don't! Maria's aboard that ship! Shahkti's mother!

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:24.230
Why would a woman like you lead the enemy here?!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.030
All I did was pray!

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:29.100
It was your hostility that brought the enemy here!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:32.630
Hostility grows within anyone who has ambition, not just me!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.200
That, too, is egotism!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.900
People like Cronicle, with their small souls and petty egotism,

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.900
are what called forth the age of space colonization!

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:43.660
Why can't you see that?!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:47.530
I was once nearly sent to the guillotine!

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:50.300
I already live in the world of the dead!

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:56.160
Unless I stop their guns, I'll never be able to save Shahkti's mother!

00:21:56.530 --> 00:21:59.260
What do we do about Queen Maria, Dad?!

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:02.160
Calm yourselves... Calm yourselves...

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:05.060
Mankind, stop fighting.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.800
Let us be wrapped in the winds of peace.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:09.700
However,

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:12.200
the waves from Angel Halo...

00:22:12.230 --> 00:22:14.060
...spread not to the battlefield,

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.060
but toward Earth's atmosphere, instead.

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:33.030
There is a life which fades away.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:38.130
For me... For all children, it was our mother.

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:41.100
There is a life which is born.

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:44.700
The brilliance of this life, which shelters a grand future,

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:49.160
is something which children know very well.

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:53.560
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:57.100
Next Episode FADING LIFE, BLOOMING LIFE
"Fading Life, Blooming Life".

00:23:57.100 --> 00:23:58.500
Please watch it!
